WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:08.080
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I am going to&nbsp;
explain an episode called “The Rank” from the Thai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:15.920
mystery thriller series called “Girl from Nowhere”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.760
The movie begins in an all-girls high school&nbsp;
in Thailand that is different from ordinary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.280
schools because it values beauty more than&nbsp;
it values education. In the opening scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.320
the director of the school announces that the&nbsp;
finals of the annual shining star competition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.960
will be held soon. The top ten beautiful&nbsp;
girls of the school will be awarded,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:44.560
among whom, one will be named the shining star of&nbsp;
the year. The only category the students need to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:50.160
exceed in order to get the award is beauty. The&nbsp;
director claims that the winner will receive an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.280
honorary trophy and as well as a special&nbsp;
prize along with several other privileges&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:00.080
throughout the rest of the year. The top ten&nbsp;
contestants will also receive extraordinary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:05.120
privileges. She ends the announcement by saying&nbsp;
that there are no ugly people in the world, just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:11.920
lazy ones. A new student Nanno is in front of the&nbsp;
school when a thin leaf falls on her and makes a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:18.160
tiny cut on her cheek. She doesn’t flinch or look&nbsp;
surprised, almost as if she had been expecting it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:23.120
But with the scar on her face, she can hardly&nbsp;
be the winner of the beauty competition.
&nbsp;

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:28.400
In the following scene, we are introduced to one&nbsp;
of the popular girls named Ying. She is currently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:33.920
ranked in the tenth position in the beauty chart&nbsp;
and is famously known as princess ten. As she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.960
walks through the hallways, her classmates try&nbsp;
to snap a picture of her to admire her beauty.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:44.960
The new girl Nanno enters the classroom and is&nbsp;
made to sit beside Ying by the teacher. Ying is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.600
also the class leader so the teacher wants&nbsp;
her to help Nanno catch up with the others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:54.480
Ying happily welcomes the new girl to the seat&nbsp;
beside her, but it isn’t clear if she genuinely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:59.920
wants to be Nanno’s friend, or considers her&nbsp;
an enemy. Nanno is just as beautiful as Ying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:05.040
if not even prettier, which is clearly&nbsp;
making Ying uncomfortable. Her face glows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:09.840
in happiness when she sees the scar&nbsp;
on Nanno’s face. To act sympathetic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:14.960
she asks her what happened. Nanno tries to dismiss&nbsp;
the matter but Ying claims that in their school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:20.800
they must take good care of themselves, and a scar&nbsp;
on the face is a huge problem. Their conversion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:26.000
is interrupted when the teacher asks them to&nbsp;
keep quiet. After the class, Ying brings Nanno&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.200
to the top ten tower. It is a building exclusive&nbsp;
to the girls who are on the top ten beauty list.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:40.320
The tower provides them with tasty food,&nbsp;
expensive makeup, and a luxurious lifestyle that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:45.040
ordinary students are not privileged with. 
Every student has a rank in the beauty list&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:51.280
that is updated in real-time. If anyone’s face&nbsp;
loses its beauty, their rank drops immediately.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:56.240
They all have an application that shows the&nbsp;
ranks of all students. Since a top ten can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.240 --> 00:03:01.600
bring one friend inside the tower, Ying asks&nbsp;
Nanno to come with her. Nanno is fascinated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:07.360
by the luxurious interior. They eat a wonderful&nbsp;
lunch while talking about several things. Nanno&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:12.560
thanks Ying for providing her with such a great&nbsp;
opportunity to be her friend. However, Ying’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:18.160
intention is not as good as she thinks it is. She&nbsp;
boasts about her lifestyle as a top ten and claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:23.760
that if Nanno wasn’t her friend, she would have to&nbsp;
eat with ordinary people in the school cafeteria.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:28.400
Nanno compliments her, commenting that she is&nbsp;
very down to earth, which couldn’t be further&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:34.080
away from the truth. In reality, Ying can do&nbsp;
anything to stay in the top ten and can hardly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:39.280
survive outside. After the meal, Nanno brings&nbsp;
out a bar of chocolate and starts to eat it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:44.800
Ying looks at the chocolate, wanting to try it&nbsp;
but scared of gaining weight. When Nanno insists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:49.840
she takes a small bite of it. Following&nbsp;
that, a girl named Chompoo approaches Ying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:55.600
calling her princess ten. She has been Ying’s&nbsp;
minion for the past few years. Before Nanno, Ying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:01.040
used to bring her to the tower as her friend, so&nbsp;
Chompoo is hurt when she sees them together. 
&nbsp;

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:06.080
To make her feel better, Ying hands her a piece&nbsp;
of cake. The workers drag Chompoo out because she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:11.040
isn’t allowed to step inside the tower without&nbsp;
a friend. After she is out, Ying says that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:17.520
feels bad for Chompoo because she has an ugly nose&nbsp;
and a big forehead. Nanno eyes Ying, knowing very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:22.880
well that she deems other people inferior&nbsp;
to her because she is prettier. Just then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:28.160
the bell rings notifying them that the number one&nbsp;
on the beauty list and the queen of the school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:33.920
Gade has arrived. They welcome her like an&nbsp;
actual queen as she descends from the stairs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:39.120
Ying introduces the rest of the beautiful girls&nbsp;
to Nanno. To make Ying feel better about herself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:44.000
Nano comments that she is as beautiful as&nbsp;
Gade, so she deserves to be this year’s queen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:49.600
Ying then urges her to scan her face in the app&nbsp;
and see what rank she is in. But her face drops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:55.600
when the app says Nanno is in eleventh place.&nbsp;
She is surprised to see her new friend is also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:00.880
her biggest competition. Ying congratulates&nbsp;
Nanno but worry is evident on her face. 
&nbsp;

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:06.560
When she leaves, we see Nanno looking at her&nbsp;
smugly. She knows that Ying is pretending to be a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:12.640
good person. She has only befriended her to teach&nbsp;
her a lesson. The following day is the worst one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:17.680
for Ying because she wakes up with a large&nbsp;
pimple on her nose. She is then informed by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:23.120
app that she had dropped to the eleventh position&nbsp;
because of the pimple. Nanno has taken her place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:27.760
in the top ten beauty list. She pops&nbsp;
the pimple which makes it even worse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.320
At school, the girls who once used to follow her&nbsp;
around for a picture, now start to make fun of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:37.600
her red nose. Ying’s day only gets worse when&nbsp;
she sees that her minions have surrounded Nanno&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:43.200
and are praising her beauty. When she walks&nbsp;
in, everyone goes silent. To add to her misery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:48.720
Nanno calls her princess Ten. Ying laughs it off&nbsp;
trying to make it seem like she doesn’t care about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:54.160
the ranking. But she is visibly jealous when she&nbsp;
sees Nanno wearing a bow that is exclusive to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.160 --> 00:06:00.160
top ten girls. A girl asks her if she had eaten&nbsp;
sweet stuff for her to get the pimple. Just then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:05.440
Ying remembers the chocolate Nanno had given her.&nbsp;
She starts to suspect her for deliberately feeding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:09.760
her sweet so she would get a pimple. 
During the lunch break, Ying walks into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:14.720
top ten tower out of habit but the workers&nbsp;
ask her to get out. Nanno tries to help her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:20.160
saying that she can be her plus one but the former&nbsp;
princess ten says she misses the cafeteria’s food&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:24.880
and leaves. However, after eating the first&nbsp;
bite of the food from there, she almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:31.440
chokes. The other students laugh at her reaction,&nbsp;
making her feel worse. She then goes to the public&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:36.400
washroom which is even worse. She places&nbsp;
toilet paper on the floor to step inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:43.120
but has to run out midway when a lizard falls&nbsp;
to the ground near her. Suffice to say that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:48.080
is miserable outside the luxury of the top ten&nbsp;
tower. She is looking for cosmetic procedures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:52.880
in a magazine when one of her former minions&nbsp;
tells her that she is now in the sixth position&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:57.840
of the top ten list. Ying is left speechless,&nbsp;
everyone she thought was lesser than she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:02.880
is now getting on the list. She runs away crying&nbsp;
at the thought of no longer being beautiful.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:07.520
The following day, she dreams of winning the&nbsp;
shining star award. But the director screams&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:12.720
after looking at her acne-filled face. She wakes&nbsp;
up panting from the nightmare and notices that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:18.400
her rank has dropped to number twenty-one. Her&nbsp;
face has two more pimples which means she won’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:23.600
be getting back on the list any time soon. 
She goes to the school with a face mask on and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:28.960
stares at the top ten tower. Later, we see&nbsp;
her at the pharmacy looking for a medicine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:35.120
to treat her acne. She meets Nanno there and runs&nbsp;
away, embarrassed of her face. Outside the shop,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:41.040
she bumps into Chompoo but doesn’t talk to her.&nbsp;
Nanno whispers something in Chompoo’s ear, panning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:46.240
something else for Ying’s downfall. The following&nbsp;
morning, Ying wakes up to see her acne has cleared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:51.280
up completely, thanks to the medication. She&nbsp;
squeals in happiness when she notices she is back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:56.720
to being number ten on the list. She is overly&nbsp;
jolly at school, which even her friends think is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:02.480
weird. She asks one of her minions to play swing&nbsp;
with her but she declines. Instead, the girl shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:08.400
her the new ranking which says she is still at&nbsp;
number eleven. Ying is once again devastated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:13.600
Nanno tries to make her feel better and asks&nbsp;
her to join her in the swing. However, Ying has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:18.640
different plans. She has had enough of playing&nbsp;
it safe, hence, to get a position in the list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:24.480
she pushes Nanno off the swing. The poor&nbsp;
girl falls face first and bruises her eyes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:29.280
Because of this, she drops from the ranking&nbsp;
and Ying gets back to being princess ten. 
&nbsp;

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:34.320
She then snatches Nanno’s bowtie and walks inside&nbsp;
the tower, without even bothering to pick her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:40.160
friend up. But as soon as she leaves, Nanno opens&nbsp;
her eyes, as if she had already planned this out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:45.440
Inside the tower, the top ten girls do not notice&nbsp;
Ying on the sofa and start to talk badly about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:50.640
her. They make fun of her for being number ten&nbsp;
for her entire life. Queen Gade claims that Ying’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:56.400
mother’s genes are to blame for her failure in&nbsp;
life. The girls laugh while Ying listens to them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.400 --> 00:09:02.240
and burns in anger. After they leave, she decides&nbsp;
to take revenge on all of them and be the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:08.640
shining star. She executes her plan that very day.&nbsp;
First, she attacks the girl in the sixth position&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:13.920
with a wild cat that scratches her face. Then,&nbsp;
she puts ants on the towel that two of the girls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:20.000
use on their faces. By the third time, she grows&nbsp;
impatient. She knocks a girl unconscious and trims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:25.360
her hair and eyebrows. For the girls in the second&nbsp;
and third positions, she mixes a chemical in their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:31.360
drinks which gives them a hairy face. Now, the&nbsp;
only person she has to defeat is Gade. She mixes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:37.520
permanent dye with a face cream which makes Gade’s&nbsp;
turn green. Since, the ranks are changing so much,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:41.920
the top beauty app glitches.
The next day, Ying comes to school&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:46.320
and sees no one around. The trash from&nbsp;
the previous days hasn't been cleaned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:52.560
and the top ten tower is also in a bad condition.&nbsp;
She walks in and sees Nanno inside. It turns out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:57.760
that since most of the top ten girls have dropped&nbsp;
to the end of the list, even with a bruised face,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:03.680
Nanno is in the third position. As they talk, Gade&nbsp;
walks down the stairs with makeup to cover up her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:09.120
green face. Ying is left speechless. She doesn’t&nbsp;
want to go back to being just a tenth place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:14.160
after having done so much to be the shining star.&nbsp;
Gade makes fun of her claiming that someone like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:20.080
her doesn’t have what it takes to be a star. Ying&nbsp;
grows furious and attacks Gade. The two get into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:25.680
a fight in which both their faces are ruined.&nbsp;
Gade’s makeup is removed while Ying gets bruises&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:31.120
and bite marks on her. After knocking Gade out,&nbsp;
Ying runs to the auditorium where the new shining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:36.720
star is being announced. After some time, the&nbsp;
much-awaited shining star winner is announced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:42.560
to be a girl that no one has ever seen. Ying&nbsp;
retaliates and asks for a reevaluation because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:47.440
the winner doesn’t even go to their school. 
Only then, it is revealed that the winner is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:53.200
Chompoo who has had a huge glow up. She thanks&nbsp;
the audience in her regular stammering voice as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:59.360
the former top ten girls look at her in jealousy.&nbsp;
Nanno smiles while looking at Chompoo, suggesting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:04.640
that this has been her plan the entire time. 
